= Otto Braun

Braun [? if chancellor = "Braun": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Braun": the current President and ?][? if spd_prussia = 1 : is ?][? if spd_prussia = 0 : was ?] the Minister-President of Prussia, the largest state in Germany. He is a reformist leader who seeks to work with the bourgeois parties.

